	 <p > (C) <b style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Preparatory Steps</b></p>

    <table  style="width:95%; border-collapse: collapse;border: 1px solid #000;font-size:15px;margin-top:1cm;">
        <tr >
            <th style="border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; text-align:center;height: 18px;width:8%;">Sr. No.</th><th style="border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; text-align:center;height: 18px;">Preparatory Work</th><th style="border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; text-align:center;height: 18px;width:8%;">Action By</th><th style="border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; text-align:center;height: 18px;width:8%;">Check</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure compliance to all MGL Life Saving Rules &amp; COP requirements.
Conduct Site specific HIRA at site. Ensure all the valves are operating correctly and accessible to be operated and in correct position at the start of NRO.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;text-align:center;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure that all the personnel involved in the shutdown operation are briefed regarding the sequence of the operation and are aware of the valve positions., 
            Social distancing, Body temperature, Moitoring periodic hand sanitization, etc. 
            as per GOM guidelines. Ensure availability of adequate quantity of hand sanitizer face mask
            thermometer etc. for the site team.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure No smoking/ No Naked flames signs are on site. Ensure compliance to all MGL Life Saving Rules and COP requirements.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">4</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure that dully calibrated Gascoseeker and Oxygen meter is available on site &amp; are in proper working conditions.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr ><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">5</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure appropriate 5 nos. of fire extinguishers (9 Kgs. each) and Non-Sparking tools are available at Site.</td><td style="border:1px solid #000;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">6</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure the fabrication &amp; testing of Valves is completed in all respects.
Refer COP: Section 051 &amp; 054</td><td>O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">7</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure all emergency fittings are available on site.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">8</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure lock out and tag out for valves to be closed during the NRO. Also ensure application of clamp as suitable before operation of valve.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">9</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"> Ensure proper Earthing of the vent hose during the venting operation.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">10</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Switched off TR unit before hot work on Steel Pipeline.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">11</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"> Ensure that all personnel involved in cold work &amp; hot work are with their recommended PPE’s.
Refer COP: Section 01 (Clause no. 6 - Personal Protective Equipment)</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">12</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Ensure usage of fire retardant suits for personnel involved in valve rectification work.</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;text-align:center;">13</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;">Intimate Jogeshwari Petrol Supply regarding closure of gas supply in (As per Annexure III)</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;height: 25px;">O&amp;M Engineer</td><td style="border: 1px solid #000;"></td></tr>
